														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4838509">
									

<p>1) You can have a meteor hit by a nuclear missile, not an asteroid. However, even if a meteor was hit by a nuke, it wouldn't likely end up as radioactive.</p>
<p>2) There already a couple of high schools and anomalous student organizations. There are even a couple of reconstructed buildings. I'm not sure combining them makes for an interesting idea. It just feels like this is the beginning of an idea and needs to be seriously fleshed out. You also need to shy away from an X-Men school.</p>
<p>3) The &quot;Hook/Attention Grabber&quot; needs to be a reason why people are interested in the SCP, not just more history. This is the best place to describe why we would be interested in the SCP, and what it offers as unique compared to other SCPs, especially those that are similar.</p>
<p>Bon chance!</p>

