<p>A birthmark which seems to make anyone around mess with you, EXCEPT ONE person.</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up extra space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) and titles short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Drama/Emotional</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> An instance wherein a person bears a birthmark. And if someone has this birthmark, anyone he/she knew and/or people he/she encounters mess up with him. This instance occurs randomly in any person living anywhere in the world. The effect starts immediately upon birth.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> the existence of this scp has tipped off the foundation through a field agent who reports that a certain teen has been bullied on, messed upon, and abused and was left by his parents and relatives alone to live for himself. It also reported that it was all caused by his birthmark on the back. At first the foundation laughed this off and didn't believe the agent. So he just investigates this on his own.<br />
investigation results and the occurrences of certain incidents has finally convinced the foundation and authorized for monitoring of possible instances of this scp, and further investigation.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong><br />
You might see some commentary on bullying or something related since this scp was inspired at it. This depicts an emotion felt by someone that was not accepted by the society because of something the he/she has.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong><br />
An scp that causes it's host to be picked off by the people around him/her, except for a certain person who, in despite of the person's comfort, love and support, still picked of and messed upon by the people around.</p>

